msgid "Line"
msgstr "线条"

#: src/dialog.c:630 src/dialog.c:663
msgid "Icon"
msgstr "图标"

#: src/dialog.c:630
msgid "None (background only)"
msgstr "无（仅背景）"

#: src/dialog.c:631
msgid "_Style:"
msgstr "样式(_S)："

#: src/dialog.c:633
msgid "Use a single panel _row"
msgstr "仅使用面板的一行(_R)"

#: src/dialog.c:635
msgid ""
"On panels with more than one row, the button takes up only one row instead "
"of the full height of the panel"
msgstr "在多行面板中，按钮只占一行，而不是占满面板的整个高度"

#: src/dialog.c:641
msgid ""
"Empty space between the button and the other items when the button is at one "
"end of the panel. It does not react to the mouse. In the middle of the panel "
"there is no gap: the button is twice as wide, with the line in the center."
msgstr ""
"当按钮位于面板一端时，按钮与其他项目之间的空白。它不响应鼠标。在面板中间没有"
"空白：按钮宽度加倍，线条位于中央。"

#: src/dialog.c:645
msgid "Gap at the panel _ends (px):"
msgstr "面板两端的间距（像素）(_E)："

#: src/dialog.c:646
msgid "General"
msgstr "常规"

#: src/dialog.c:655
msgid "_Icon:"
msgstr "图标(_I)："

#: src/dialog.c:658
msgid "Icon si_ze (px):"
msgstr "图标大小(_Z)（像素）："

#: src/dialog.c:660
msgid "_Follow the panel icon size"
msgstr "跟随面板图标大小(_F)"

#: src/dialog.c:673
msgid "C_opy"
msgstr "复制(_O)"

#: src/dialog.c:675
msgid "Replace all settings of this button with those of the selected one"
msgstr "用所选按钮的设置替换此按钮的全部设置"

#: src/dialog.c:679
msgid "_From:"
msgstr "来源(_F)："

#: src/dialog.c:683
msgid "Copy settings from another button"
msgstr "从其他按钮复制设置"

#: src/dialog.c:693
msgid "Line _width (px):"
msgstr "线条粗细(_W)（像素）："

